{"title": "3 Main concept, part C2 open", "html": "<div style=\"width:1440px;height:900px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;background:#f2f2ef;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Inter','Helvetica Neue',Arial,sans-serif;position:relative;padding:8px 72px 0;box-sizing:border-box\"><div style=\"padding:32px 0 0\"><div style=\"font:650 28px/1.15 -apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Inter','Helvetica Neue',Arial,sans-serif;letter-spacing:-.01em;color:#18181a;margin-top:0px\">How an AI coding agent works</div><div style=\"font:400 16px/1.6 -apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Inter','Helvetica Neue',Arial,sans-serif;color:#57575a;margin-top:10px;text-align:justify;hyphens:auto\">An AI coding agent is a <span style=\"color:#18181a;text-decoration:underline;text-decoration-color:#3e63dd;text-decoration-thickness:1.5px;text-underline-offset:4px\">language model</span> run in a loop with <span style=\"color:#18181a;text-decoration:underline;text-decoration-color:#3e63dd;text-decoration-thickness:1.5px;text-underline-offset:4px\">tools</span>. Your request goes into its <span style=\"color:#18181a;text-decoration:underline;text-decoration-color:#3e63dd;text-decoration-thickness:1.5px;text-underline-offset:4px\">context window</span>, the working memory that holds everything the model can see: its instructions, your task, the files it has read and the result of every step so <span style=\"white-space:nowrap\">far.<sup style=\"font:600 10px/0 ui-monospace,'SF Mono',Menlo,Consolas,monospace;color:#3e63dd;margin-left:1px\">[1]</sup></span> On each step the model reads the whole context and answers with text or a <span style=\"color:#18181a;text-decoration:underline;text-decoration-color:#3e63dd;text-decoration-thickness:1.5px;text-underline-offset:4px\">tool call</span>, a structured request such as <span style=\"white-space:nowrap\">edit_file(auth.ts).<sup style=\"font:600 10px/0 ui-monospace,'SF Mono',Menlo,Consolas,monospace;color:#3e63dd;margin-left:1px\">[2]</sup></span> The program around the model, the <span style=\"color:#18181a;text-decoration:underline;text-decoration-color:#3e63dd;text-decoration-thickness:1.5px;text-underline-offset:4px\">harness</span>, runs that tool against your code and appends the result to the context. The loop repeats (read, act, observe) until the tests pass or the model decides the task is done. Nothing is remembered outside the context, so when it fills up, older steps are <span style=\"color:#18181a;text-decoration:underline;text-decoration-color:#3e63dd;text-decoration-thickness:1.5px;text-underline-offset:4px\">summarized</span> to make <span style=\"white-space:nowrap\">room.<sup style=\"font:600 10px/0 ui-monospace,'SF Mono',Menlo,Consolas,monospace;color:#3e63dd;margin-left:1px\">[3]</sup></span></div></div><div style=\"flex:1;min-height:0;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;margin:16px 0 60px\"><div style=\"position:relative;width:100%\"><svg width=\"950\" height=\"440\" viewBox=\"26 26 950 440\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"An AI coding agent loop: a task enters the context window, the model reads it and calls a tool, the tool changes the repo, and the result is appended to the context for the next step.\" style=\"display:block;overflow:visible;width:100%;height:auto\"><rect x=\"31\" y=\"34\" width=\"210\" height=\"110\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#dcdcd9\" stroke=\"none\" stroke-width=\"0.8\" opacity=\".55\"/><rect x=\"30\" y=\"30\" width=\"210\" height=\"110\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#ffffff\" stroke=\"#8a8a8f\" stroke-width=\"0.8\" /><path d=\"M34.8 135 L235.2 135\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#d4d4d6\" stroke-width=\"0.8\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" /><rect x=\"35\" y=\"35\" width=\"200\" height=\"95\" rx=\"5\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#d4d4d6\" stroke-width=\"0.6\" /><rect x=\"30\" y=\"30\" width=\"210\" height=\"20\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#ededea\" stroke=\"none\" stroke-width=\"0.8\" /><path d=\"M30 50 L240 50\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#d4d4d6\" stroke-width=\"0.8\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" /><circle cx=\"44\" cy=\"40\" r=\"3\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#b4b4b8\" stroke-width=\".7\"/><circle cx=\"55\" cy=\"40\" r=\"3\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#b4b4b8\" stroke-width=\".7\"/><circle cx=\"66\" cy=\"40\" r=\"3\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#b4b4b8\" stroke-width=\".7\"/><text x=\"46\" y=\"74\" font-family=\"ui-monospace,'SF Mono',Menlo,Consolas,monospace\" font-size=\"10.5\" fill=\"#18181a\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-weight=\"400\" letter-spacing=\"0\" >&gt; fix the failing</text><text x=\"46\" y=\"92\" font-family=\"ui-monospace,'SF Mono',Menlo,Consolas,monospace\" font-size=\"10.5\" fill=\"#18181a\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-weight=\"400\" letter-spacing=\"0\" >  test in auth.ts</text><rect x=\"46\" y=\"102\" width=\"7\" height=\"12\" fill=\"#26262a\" opacity=\".7\"/><rect x=\"209.2\" y=\"37\" width=\"22.8\" height=\"14\" rx=\"7\" fill=\"#e6edfe\" stroke=\"#3e63dd\" stroke-width=\"0.9\" /><text x=\"220.6\" y=\"47\" font-family=\"ui-monospace,'SF Mono',Menlo,Consolas,monospace\" font-size=\"8\" fill=\"#3e63dd\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"600\" letter-spacing=\".04em\">C1</text><text x=\"203.2\" y=\"47.5\" font-family=\"-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Inter','Helvetica Neue',Arial,sans-serif\" font-size=\"10.5\" font-weight=\"500\" fill=\"#57575a\" text-anchor=\"end\">Your request, typed once</text><path d=\"M135 140 L135 186\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#b4b4b8\" stroke-width=\"7\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/><path d=\"M135 140 L135 186\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#ffffff\" stroke-width=\"5.4\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/><path d=\"M132.6 161.0 L135.0 164.0 L137.4 161.0\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#8a8a8f\" stroke-width=\"0.8\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" /><text x=\"145\" y=\"167\" font-family=\"-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Inter','Helvetica Neue',Arial,sans-serif\" font-size=\"9\" font-style=\"italic\" fill=\"#8c8c90\" text-anchor=\"start\">task enters the context</text><rect x=\"31\" y=\"19