-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Inter','Helvetica Neue',Arial,sans-serif;color:#18181a\">Context window</span></div><span style=\"font:400 18px/1 -apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Inter','Helvetica Neue',Arial,sans-serif;color:#8c8c90\">&#215;</span></div><div style=\"font:400 13.5px/1.5 -apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Inter','Helvetica Neue',Arial,sans-serif;color:#57575a;margin-top:10px\">Everything the model can see on this step: its instructions, your task, the files it has read, and the result of every tool call so far. It is re-read in full on every step. Anything not in it does not exist for the model.</div><div style=\"font:500 9.5px/1 ui-monospace,'SF Mono',Menlo,Consolas,monospace;letter-spacing:.12em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#8c8c90;margin:14px 0 8px\">How it connects</div><div style=\"font:400 13px/1.7 -apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Inter','Helvetica Neue',Arial,sans-serif;color:#57575a\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;padding:3px 7px;border-radius:7px;border:1px solid #3e63dd;background:#e6edfe;font:600 10px/1 ui-monospace,'SF Mono',Menlo,Consolas,monospace;color:#3e63dd;margin-right:5px\">C1</span>your task enters it once<br><span style=\"display:inline-block;padding:3px 7px;border-radius:7px;border:1px solid #3e63dd;background:#e6edfe;font:600 10px/1 ui-monospace,'SF Mono',Menlo,Consolas,monospace;color:#3e63dd;margin-right:5px\">C3</span>the model reads all of it each step<br><span style=\"display:inline-block;padding:3px 7px;border-radius:7px;border:1px solid #3e63dd;background:#e6edfe;font:600 10px/1 ui-monospace,'SF Mono',Menlo,Consolas,monospace;color:#3e63dd;margin-right:5px\">C6</span>every tool result is appended to it<br><span style=\"display:inline-block;padding:3px 7px;border-radius:7px;border:1px solid #3e63dd;background:#e6edfe;font:600 10px/1 ui-monospace,'SF Mono',Menlo,Consolas,monospace;color:#3e63dd;margin-right:5px\">L2 B1</span>it has a size limit; when full, old items are summarized</div><div style=\"font:500 9.5p